     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Plain films"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ", if done, may show pancreatic duct calcifications (chronic pancreatitis), calcified gallstones, a "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "“sentinel loop”"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " (localized ileus of a small-bowel segment in the LUQ or center of the abd) or the "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "colon cutoff sign"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " in more severe dz; their routine value = unclear"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
