      ],
      "text": "CXR"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " should be done and may show atelectasis or a pleural effusion (USU left-sided or bilat), signs of severe dz"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
